  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 72e6c5d27854f7a43ac9976f66063431, type: 3}
  m_Name: OpeningScript
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Pickleball.Cutscene::Pickleball.Cutscene.Script.CutsceneScript
  sourcePath: Docs/Story/OpeningCutscenes.md
  scenes:
  - number: 1
    title: The white void
    notes:
    - Pure white. No sound. MC is lying on his back in nothing at all. He sits up
      slowly.
    - 'The white swells, then resolves into the courtyard: green lawn, columns, gold
      sunlight.'
  - number: 2
    title: The lost propeller
    notes:
    - A sputtering whine overhead. Birdy drops out of the sky, bounces off the lawn
      and scrambles in circles, patting his empty helmet.
    - 'Gameplay: the platforming section to find the propeller.'
  - number: 3
    title: '"You''re the one"'
    notes:
    - MC holds out the propeller. Birdy snatches it, clicks it onto his helmet, and
      it whirs to life. He lifts a few inches off the ground, wobbling.
  - number: 4
    title: The path
    notes:
    - Jump cut. MC walks a winding stone path between olive trees. Birdy putters
      along beside him at shoulder height.
  - number: 5
    title: The Academy
    notes:
    - 'The path crests a rise. The whole Academy opens up below: columns, domes,
      terracotta roofs, the gnomon at the centre.'
    - MC stares at him. Birdy beams back. The jokes end here.
  - number: 6
    title: The world coming apart
    notes:
    - 'MC''s eyes drift north. Past the Academy, the edge of the world is fraying:
      marble breaks into floating shapes, then ink lines, then blank white. Above
      it hangs a perfectly black sun.'
    - Birdy's rotor whirs and he zips ahead down the path. MC looks at the black
      sun a moment longer, then follows. Gameplay begins.
